Thistle Monroe, styled Second-Among-Equals, is the person the [[Org/The Harlequins/index|Harlequins]] named as most likely to knowingly lead the Party to [[Phenomena/Keystone|keystone]] 15. The Party learned the name from the prism game at the [[Geography/Calaria/Ragged Roost|Ragged Roost]] pilgrimage, and knows nothing else of them.
